import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 821 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos · Overview — The Transcended One's Cosmic-Grade Duties","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 821 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos · Overview — The Transcended One's Cosmic-Grade Duties","no":821,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Cosmos","Cosmic-Grade Duties","Overview","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","20-Anchor Structure and Levels"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0821_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-总论.md","filePath":"en/0821_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0821_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-总论.md"};function s(r,e,d,l,c,u){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-821-transcended-ones-and-the-cosmos-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-cosmic-grade-duties" tabindex="-1">Entry 821 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Cosmic-Grade Duties <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-821-transcended-ones-and-the-cosmos-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-cosmic-grade-duties" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 821 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Cosmic-Grade Duties&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 00, 17, 20</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-the-cosmos-master-but-its-gardener" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one is not the cosmos&#39; master, but its gardener <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-the-cosmos-master-but-its-gardener" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one is not the cosmos&#39; master, but its gardener&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s imagination of a &quot;cosmic-grade strong one&quot; is: he stands at the cosmos&#39; peak, looks down on all beings, the whole cosmos is his back garden. This imagination treats the cosmos as the strong one&#39;s private estate. Heng Yuan Zhou completely negates this definition. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s orthodox framework, <strong>the transcended one&#39;s relationship to the cosmos is not master-to-property, but gardener-to-garden.</strong> The cosmos is not the transcended one&#39;s private estate, but Myriad Ranks&#39; common home; the transcended one guards the cosmos not because the cosmos belongs to him, but because the cosmos needs someone to guard it.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all take effect in this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires cosmic-grade power never be privatized; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires cosmic governance power belong to all Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties serve the cosmos&#39; overall uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cosmic-grade operations follow the strictest reporting approval; the law-first axiom ensures cosmic-grade duties&#39; definition itself is law-level setting, not changed by any plot convenience.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article, as the &quot;Transcended Ones and the Cosmos&quot; sub-series overview, sorts out the transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties panorama at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm level.</p><h2 id="i-cosmic-grade-duties-five-layers" tabindex="-1">I. Cosmic-Grade Duties&#39; Five Layers <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-cosmic-grade-duties-five-layers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Cosmic-Grade Duties&#39; Five Layers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview (Document 00), the transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties from micro to macro divide into five layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Duty Content</th><th>Corresponding Cosmic Structure</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Micro layer</td><td>Guard individual cultivators&#39; safety and growth</td><td>Material plane · individual</td></tr><tr><td>Meso layer</td><td>Maintain plane civilization&#39;s healthy development</td><td>Material plane · civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Macro layer</td><td>Maintain the cross-plane law network&#39;s stability</td><td>Law network · cross-plane</td></tr><tr><td>Hyper layer</td><td>Push the cosmos overall to high-dimensional uplift</td><td>Cosmic origin · uplift</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmic layer</td><td>Participate in the multiverse structure&#39;s interconnection and co-rule</td><td>Multiverse · structure</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The first three layers have been detailed in previous entries (plane management, law maintenance, cross-plane construction). This article focuses on the latter two layers: <strong>cosmic uplift</strong> and <strong>multiverse interconnection</strong> — these are duties only Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended ones may bear.</p><h2 id="ii-why-cosmic-grade-duties-are-needed" tabindex="-1">II. Why Cosmic-Grade Duties Are Needed <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-cosmic-grade-duties-are-needed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Cosmic-Grade Duties Are Needed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some ask: matters on planes are already enough, why does the transcended one still need to worry about &quot;cosmic-grade&quot; matters? The answer: <strong>the cosmos itself is also aging.</strong> Any cosmos not actively maintained will along the entropy-increase law head toward heat death — energy dissipated, laws decayed, life extinct. Cosmic-grade duties exist precisely to counter this natural trend.</p><p>Concretely, cosmic-grade duties address three natural trends:</p><ul><li><strong>Entropy-increase trend</strong>: the cosmos&#39; total energy under natural conditions continuously dissipates into unusable background radiation. The transcended one&#39;s duty is to counter entropy increase through the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s entropy-reduction engineering (see entry 803);</li><li><strong>Law-aging trend</strong>: the cosmos&#39; law parameters over time gradually drift; the law network&#39;s operating efficiency gradually declines. The transcended one&#39;s duty is to delay law aging through law-calibration maintenance (see entry 820);</li><li><strong>Isolation-fragmentation trend</strong>: planes and cosmic structures in the multiverse naturally tend to isolation — plane barriers thicken, exchanges dwindle. The transcended one&#39;s duty is to counter fragmentation through cross-plane anchor construction (see entry 818).</li></ul><p>Three trends not countered, the cosmos slowly dies from within. The transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties are to let the cosmos &quot;live&quot; longer and &quot;live&quot; better.</p><h2 id="iii-cosmic-grade-duties-and-individual-cultivation-s-difference" tabindex="-1">III. Cosmic-Grade Duties and Individual Cultivation&#39;s Difference <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cosmic-grade-duties-and-individual-cultivation-s-difference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cosmic-Grade Duties and Individual Cultivation&#39;s Difference&quot;">​</a></h2><p>An individual cultivator&#39;s goal is &quot;make myself stronger&quot;; the transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties are &quot;make the cosmos better.&quot; These two goals are not contradictory, but their directions are entirely different:</p><ul><li>Individual cultivation: energy flows into his own body; his own realm rises;</li><li>Cosmic-grade duties: energy is dispatched through him into the Myriad-Rank cycle; the cosmos&#39; order rises.</li></ul><p>A transcended one who only focuses on individual cultivation, his power stays at the Origin Realm — because he does not participate in cosmic-grade duties, his civilizational weight cannot rise, law-anchor authority cannot rise. Only by unifying individual cultivation and cosmic-grade duties — <strong>the purpose of growing stronger is to be able to bear greater cosmic-grade duties</strong> — may he truly enter the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm.</p><p>This is the collective ascension axiom&#39;s deep meaning: <strong>the strong do not ascend alone, but lift Myriad Ranks forward into evolution.</strong> The transcended one&#39;s power is not his personal achievement, but the tool by which he bears cosmic-grade duties.</p><h2 id="iv-cosmic-grade-duties-responsible-subject-not-one-person-but-a-group" tabindex="-1">IV. Cosmic-Grade Duties&#39; Responsible Subject: Not One Person, but a Group <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cosmic-grade-duties-responsible-subject-not-one-person-but-a-group" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cosmic-Grade Duties&#39; Responsible Subject: Not One Person, but a Group&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cosmic-grade duties&#39; scale is too large — too large for any single transcended one to bear alone. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s design: <strong>cosmic-grade duties are jointly borne by a group of transcended ones, completed through division of labor and collaboration.</strong></p><p>Division-of-labor method:</p><ul><li>Different transcended ones are responsible for law maintenance in different cosmic regions;</li><li>Different transcended ones are responsible for civilizational guidance of different plane types;</li><li>Different transcended ones are responsible for different lines of the cross-plane anchor network;</li><li>Major cosmic-grade projects (such as cosmic-uplift promotion, new-cosmos weaving) are coordinated by multiple transcended ones.</li></ul><p>Group division of labor ensures: any one transcended one goes offline, cosmic-grade duties do not stop — others may fill in. This is network-style transcendence (protagonist-uniqueness dependency extremely low) at cosmic-grade duties&#39; embodiment.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmic-grade duties&#39; group division of labor avoids management inefficiency caused by a single transcended one&#39;s energy being over-dispersed</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cosmic-grade duties&#39; public design ensures cosmic energy and laws are not privatized by any single transcended one</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, cosmic-grade strong ones alone rule the cosmos, Myriad Ranks prostrate; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmic-grade duties are borne by group division of labor, Myriad-Rank co-governance</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: all cosmic-grade duties&#39; results (law maintenance, uplift promotion, interconnection construction) benefit all Myriad-Rank life forms</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cosmic-grade duties&#39; five layers, division-of-labor method, and responsibility system are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise duty performance</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors operation compliance throughout.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s cosmic-grade duties are essentially the post-performance of the civilization-level mission of &quot;guarding the cosmos.&quot; He is not the cosmos&#39; master, but its gardener; not all things&#39; sovereign, but all things&#39; sustainer. What he guards is not some plane, some race, but the whole cosmos&#39; perpetual operation — countering entropy increase, delaying aging, preventing fragmentation. When a group of transcended ones jointly bear cosmic-grade duties, the cosmos is no longer a wilderness left to age naturally, but a garden Myriad Ranks jointly cultivate. The transcended one transcends not because he stands at the cosmos&#39; peak, but because he squats down and, together with Myriad Ranks, waters, weeds, and prunes the cosmos.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">Entry 00 · Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Levels</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/816_模块4-超脱者与位面-总论.html">Entry 816 · Transcended Ones and Planes Overview</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const g=n(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
